    assert histogram('a b c a b c a b c a b') == {'a': 3, 'b': 3, 'c': 4}
    assert histogram('a b c a b c a b c a b c a b') == {'a': 4, 'b': 4, 'c': 4}
```

These tests cover a variety of scenarios, including the case where all letters occur the same, and the case where some letters occur more than others.

